face-image: img/events/belgrano.jpg

= The South Atlantic War

The task force is in the Exclusion Zone around the islands. The Argentine cruiser General Belgrano is sailing outside it with two destroyers. The commander of the task force says it is a threat to the carriers and asks for permission to attack.

- @sink: Authorise the attack on the Belgrano.
- @hold_fire: Hold fire while the Peruvian peace plan is discussed.

@sink
on-arrival: {!
var odds = 78 + (Q.us_relation - 50) / 2 + (Q.defence_cuts ? -8 : 6) + 6;
Q.falklands_odds = Math.round(odds);
Q.war_won = (Math.random() * 100 < odds) ? 1 : 0;
Q.europe_relation -= 3;
!}
go-to: victory if war_won = 1; defeat if war_won = 0

The Belgrano is sunk by the submarine HMS Conqueror. 323 Argentine sailors die. The Argentine navy returns to port and stays there for the rest of the war.

@hold_fire
on-arrival: {!
var odds = 78 + (Q.us_relation - 50) / 2 + (Q.defence_cuts ? -8 : 6) - 8;
Q.falklands_odds = Math.round(odds);
Q.war_won = (Math.random() * 100 < odds) ? 1 : 0;
!}
go-to: victory if war_won = 1; defeat if war_won = 0

The Belgrano returns to port. The peace plan collapses within days, and the Argentine navy remains a threat to the carriers for the rest of the campaign.

