= Victory

After landings at San Carlos, battles at Goose Green and on the mountains around Stanley, the Argentine garrison surrenders on 14 June. 255 British servicemen and three islanders have died.

When South Georgia was retaken in April, you told reporters outside Number 10 to "just rejoice at that news". Now the whole country does. Your poll ratings soar.

@defeat
