!}

= Disaster

Exocet missiles and bombs sink two carriers within a week. Without air cover, the landings are impossible, and the task force has to turn for home. The islands stay in Argentine hands.

The country is stunned. In the Commons, the question is no longer whether there will be a leadership challenge, but when.
